{% endfor %}

Example comparison:

```bash
diff -u \
  evidence_pack/raw/{{ collection_results_payload.run.run_id }}/baseline/leaf1/tenant_learning.txt \
  evidence_pack/raw/{{ collection_results_payload.run.run_id }}/post_probe/leaf1/tenant_learning.txt
```

